hadiths[26]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum sikhaye hue kutte chhorte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Jo wo tumhare liye rokein khayiye. Main ne arz kiya: Agarche wo qatl karein? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche wo qatl karein. Main ne arz kiya: Aur beshak hum mi'rad se nishana marte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Jo phaade khayiye. Aur jo us ke aade lage wo na khayiye."
"1255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak hum qaum hain jo in kutton se shikar karte hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apne sikhaye hue kutte chhoro aur Allah ka naam lo to jo wo tumhare liye rokein us mein se khayiye, agarche wo qatl karein. Magar kutta khaye to main darta hun ke wo use apne liye roke. Aur agar un se us ke siwa kutte mil jayein to na khayiye."
"1256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mi'rad ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab wo apni dhaar se lage to khayiye. Aur jab wo apne aade se lage to na khayiye, kyunke wo dab kar mara hua hai. Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main apna kutta chhorta hun aur naam leta hun. Phir us ke sath shikar par doosra kutta pata hun jis par main ne naam nahi liya, aur main nahi janta un dono mein se kis ne pakda? Aap ne farmaya: Na khayiye. Tum ne to apne kutte par naam liya, doosre par naam nahi liya."
"1257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mi'rad ke shikar ke bare mein poochha. Aap ne farmaya: Jo apni dhaar se lage use khayiye. Aur jo apne aade se lage wo dab kar mara hua hai. Aur main ne Aap se kutte ke shikar ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo tumhare liye roke khayiye. Kyunke kutte ka pakadna zibah hai. Aur agar tum apne kutte ya kutton ke sath us ke siwa kutta pao aur tumhe dar ho ke wo use us ke sath pakde, jabke us ne use qatl kiya ho to na khayiye. Kyunke tum ne Allah ka naam apne kutte par liya, us ke siwa par naam nahi liya."
"1258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apna kutta chhoro aur naam lo, phir wo roke aur qatl kare to khayiye. Aur agar wo khaye to na khayiye, kyunke us ne apne liye roka. Aur jab wo aise kutton se mile jin par Allah ka naam nahi liya gaya, phir wo rokein aur qatl karein to na khayiye. Kyunke tum nahi jante un mein se kis ne qatl kiya. Aur agar tum shikar ko teer maro aur use ek ya do din baad pao jabke us mein tumhare teer ke nishan ke siwa kuchh na ho to khayiye. Aur agar wo pani mein gire to na khayiye."
"1259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Tha'laba al-Khushani (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Nabiullah! Beshak hum Ahle Kitab ki qaum ki zameen mein hain. To kya hum un ke bartanon mein khayein? Aur shikar ki zameen mein hun. Apni kaman se shikar karta hun, apne ghair sikhaye kutte se aur apne sikhaye kutte se. Phir mere liye kya durust hai? Aap ne farmaya: Raha jo tum ne Ahle Kitab ka zikr kiya, agar tum us ke siwa pao to us mein na khayiye. Aur agar na pao to use dhoyein aur us mein khayiye. Aur jo tum ne apni kaman se shikar kiya aur Allah ka naam liya to khayiye. Aur jo tum ne apne sikhaye kutte se shikar kiya aur Allah ka naam liya to khayiye. Aur jo tum ne apne ghair sikhaye kutte se shikar kiya aur us ke zibah ko pao to khayiye."
"1260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Tha'laba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne daant wale har darinde ke khane se mana farmaya."
"1261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein teen sau sawar bheja. Hamare ameer Abu Ubaida bin al-Jarrah they. Hum Quraish ke qafile ka intezar karte. Phir hum samandar ke kinare aadha mahina thehre. Phir hamein sakht bhook lagi yahan tak ke hum ne peepal ke patte khaye. Phir us lashkar ka naam Jaish al-Khabt rakha gaya. Phir samandar ne hamare liye janwar phenka jise Anbar kaha jata hai. Phir hum ne us mein se aadha mahina khaya. Aur us ki charbi se tel lagaya. Yahan tak ke hamare jism hamari taraf laute. Phir Abu Ubaida ne us ki pasliyon mein se ek pasli li aur use nasb kiya. Phir apne sath sab se lambe mard ki taraf gaye. Aur ek mard aur oont liya. Phir us ke neeche se guzra. Jabir ne kaha: Aur qaum mein se ek shakhs ne teen oont zibah kiye. Phir teen oont zibah kiye. Phir teen oont zibah kiye. Phir Abu Ubaida ne use mana kiya."
"1262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din aurton se mut'a se mana farmaya, aur paltu gadhon ke khane se."
"1263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Tha'laba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne paltu gadhon ke gosht ko haram farmaya."
"1264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne paltu gadhon ke gosht khane se mana farmaya."
"1265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Khaibar ki raaton mein bhook lagi. Phir jab Khaibar ka din tha to hum paltu gadhon par pade aur unhe zibah kiya. Phir jab handiyan ublein to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi ne pukara: Handiyan undel do. Phir gadhon ke gosht mein se kuchh na khayiye. Abdullah ne kaha [wo Ibn Abi Aufa hain]: Phir hum ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sirf is liye mana farmaya kyunke us ka khums nahi nikala gaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Aur doosron ne kaha: Aap ne use mukammal haram farmaya."
"1266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara aur Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath they. Phir unhon ne gadhe paye aur unhe pakaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi ne pukara: Handiyan undel do."
"1267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main nahi janta ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se mana farmaya is liye ke wo logon ki sawari tha aur Aap ne na-pasand farmaya ke un ki sawari jaye, ya Aap ne use Khaibar ke din haram farmaya, paltu gadhon ka gosht."
"1268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din jalti huein aagein dekhein. Aap ne farmaya: Ye aagein kis par jalayi jati hain? Unhon ne kaha: Paltu gadhon par. Aap ne farmaya: Unhe todo aur bahao. Unhon ne kaha: Kya hum unhe bahayein aur dhoyein? Aap ne farmaya: Dhoyein."
"1269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya, aur ghodon mein ijazat di."
"1270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein ghoda zibah kiya. Phir use khaya."
"1271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Goa, main use nahi khata aur haram nahi karta."
"1272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se kuchh log they, un mein Sa'd they. Phir wo gosht mein se khane lage. Phir unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se ek aurat ne pukara: Beshak wo goa ka gosht hai. Phir wo ruke. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khayiye ya khilayiye. Kyunke wo halal hai. Ya farmaya: Us mein koi harj nahi. Lekin wo mera khana nahi hai."
"1273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khalid bin al-Walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Maimuna ke paas dakhil hue, jo un ki khala thein, Ibn Abbas ki khala. Phir unhon ne un ke paas bhuni hui goa payi jo un ki behan Hufaida bint al-Harith Najd se layi thein. Phir unhon ne goa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pesh ki. Aur Aap kam hi apna hath khane ke liye badhate yahan tak ke Aap ko us ke bare mein khabar di jati aur us ka naam liya jata. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna hath goa ki taraf badhaya. Phir hazir aurton mein se ek aurat ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar do jo tum ne Aap ke paas pesh kiya hai. Wo goa hai Ya Rasulullah! Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna hath goa se uthaya. Phir Khalid bin al-Walid ne kaha: Kya goa haram hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Lekin wo meri qaum ki zameen mein na thi. Phir main pata hun ke mujhe nafrat hai. Khalid ne kaha: Phir main ne use kheench liya aur khaya, jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri taraf dekh rahe they."
"1274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ki khala Umm Hufaid ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko paneer, ghee aur goa hadiya ki. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne paneer aur ghee mein se khaya. Aur goa nafrat se chhori. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke dastarkhwan par khayi gayi. Aur agar haram hoti to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke dastarkhwan par na khayi jati."
"1275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath saat ya chhe ladaiyan ladein. Hum Aap ke sath tiddi khate they."
"1276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Marr al-Zahran mein khargosh bhagaya. Phir qaum daudi aur thak gayi. Phir main ne use paya aur pakda. Phir use Abu Talha ke paas laya. Phir unhon ne use zibah kiya. Aur use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf us ki raan ya dono ranein bhejin. Phir Aap ne use qubool farmaya aur us mein se khaya."
"1277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek shakhs ko gulel se marte dekha. Phir us se kaha: Gulel se na maro. Kyunke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne gulel se mana farmaya, ya gulel ko na-pasand farmate. Aur farmaya: Beshak us se shikar nahi kiya jata aur dushman ko zakhmi nahi kiya jata. Lekin wo daant tod sakti hai aur aankh phod sakti hai. Phir usے is ke baad gulel se marte dekha. Phir us se kaha: Main tumhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan karta hun ke Aap ne gulel se mana farmaya ya gulel ko na-pasand farmaya, aur tum gulel se marte ho? Main tum se itna aur itna baat nahi karunga."
"1278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne janwaron ko bandh kar nishana banane se mana farmaya."
"1279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Sa'id bin Jubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas tha. Phir wo naujawanon ya giroh ke paas se guzre jinhon ne murghi bandh rakhi thi aur use maar rahe they. Phir jab unhon ne Ibn Umar ko dekha to us se muntashir ho gaye. Aur Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ye kis ne kiya? Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par lanat farmayi jo ye kare."
